# slice2 (docs/wsp/research/phys_slice2.md, sha256 333af88eb8ebed9988827578829fc7f74b53f71e1fe0807ffa01e36e1e343906): the W0 block of phys_slice_w0.md 7.4 with every lifted.logit.* line written as past_lift.logit.*, then the new lines
